[
  {
    "id": "h-623",
    "book": "hymnal",
    "no": 623,
    "title": "主，我們就是為此聚集",
    "firstLine": "主，我們就是為此聚集，同來記念你的愛",
    "categories": ["記念主", "主的救贖", "基督的所是"],
    "key": "降E大調",
    "time": "4/4",
    "meter": "8.7.8.7 副",
    "hasChorus": true,
    "enNo": 213,
    "urls": {
      "hymnal": "https://www.hymnal.net/en/hymn/ch/623",
      "luke54": ["https://www.luke54.org/hymn/ch/623"]
    },
    "notes": [
      {
        "type": "excerpt",
        "text": "餅和杯把我們帶回十字架前，也帶到主的身位面前。",
        "source": "hymnal.net 詩歌背景",
        "url": "https://www.hymnal.net/en/hymn/ch/623"
      },
      {
        "type": "scripture",
        "text": "你們每逢喫這餅，喝這杯，是宣告主的死，直等到祂來。",
        "source": "林前 11:26",
        "url": "https://cwwl.twgbr.org/verse/1co/11/26"
      },
      {
        "type": "tip",
        "text": "擘餅第一首用這首起頭很順，副歌可以重複一次再過渡到下一首。",
        "source": "帶詩歌筆記",
        "url": "https://www.luke54.org/hymn/ch/623"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
