        "url": "https://www.hymnal.net/en/hymn/ch/147"
      },
      {
        "type": "tip",
        "text": "節數多，聚會中選 1、2、4 節就夠，不必唱完。",
        "source": "帶詩歌筆記",
        "url": "https://www.luke54.org/hymn/ch/147"
      }
    ]
